	<section_number>18.2-504.1</section_number>
	<catch_line>Unlawful change of name; punishment</catch_line>
	<text>
		If any person residing in this Commonwealth changes his name or assumes another name, unlawfully, he shall be guilty of a Class 3 misdemeanor.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 8-577.1; 1956, c. 402; 1973, c. 401; 1976, c. 115; 1977, c. 624.</history>
